This project is a 3D printed camera case.
It is designed using openJsCad V2
Documentation is available: https://openjscad.xyz/v2/dokuwiki/doku.php?id=en:start

# Parts

Case is made of 4 parts:
- Lower body is the most complex part. This is where most of the camera components will sit. It also contains a trapezoidal trap for a 2mm joint rope all around the lower body to upper body shape. 
- Upper body just comes to close the case over the lowe Body. It just contains a hole for the camera cap to be inserted.
- Camera cap comes on top of the upper body. It protects camera sensor from direct sun exposure and also provide a thermic shielding.
- USB Bottle cap is a simple part that comes to close the case over the USB port.

# Variants

There are 2 variants of the case:
- Tangxi camera
- Sainsmart camera

Sainsmart sensor has a smaller PCB than Tangxi sensor.

# Files

./models contains all the models for the case.

./models/camera.js is the main files, that's the one that reuses all the other models to build the final case.

All other files are self-explanatory based on their names.

models/constants.js contains all the constants for the case.
models/utils.js contains all the utility functions for the case.

Some files are not actively used but are kept here because they might be useful in the future.
* models/additional-cards-mount.js
* models/rope.js


